WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.487 --> 00:00:02.547
- My comic book skills are like...

00:00:02.547 --> 00:00:03.172
- Zero.

00:00:03.172 --> 00:00:04.249
- My four-year-old son draws

00:00:04.249 --> 00:00:05.854
better comic books than I do.

00:00:05.854 --> 00:00:10.422
(upbeat music)

00:00:16.430 --> 00:00:19.132
My dream superhero is very sensitive,

00:00:19.132 --> 00:00:23.074
kind guy whose gift is posing

00:00:23.074 --> 00:00:25.715
in bodybuilding contests and also

00:00:25.715 --> 00:00:28.051
helping people understand the world over.

00:00:28.051 --> 00:00:30.469
We call him Mr. Understanding.

00:00:30.469 --> 00:00:31.952
- Does he have a weakness?

00:00:31.952 --> 00:00:33.517
- His weakness is he's just too kind.

00:00:33.517 --> 00:00:35.305
Sometimes he just feels too much.

00:00:35.305 --> 00:00:36.341
You know what I mean?

00:00:36.341 --> 00:00:36.738
He just--

00:00:36.738 --> 00:00:37.591
- That's great, is he bald?

00:00:37.591 --> 00:00:38.485
Does he have hair?

00:00:38.485 --> 00:00:39.704
- He has to be bald because he has to

00:00:39.704 --> 00:00:41.594
understand the feelings of the people

00:00:41.594 --> 00:00:42.406
who have no hair.

00:00:42.406 --> 00:00:44.282
He has to be able to identify with them.

00:00:48.725 --> 00:00:51.630
- Mine's gonna, you know,
it's gonna be a dude.

00:00:51.630 --> 00:00:53.043
I like female superheroes, but I like

00:00:53.043 --> 00:00:54.201
to be in love with my superheroes

00:00:54.201 --> 00:00:55.481
and I like dudes.

00:00:55.481 --> 00:00:59.220
He is holding a baby 'cause he's a dad

00:00:59.220 --> 00:01:00.723
and he's carrying a diaper bag.

00:01:00.723 --> 00:01:02.166
And also, wait a second, wait,

00:01:02.166 --> 00:01:04.705
and then back here is,

00:01:04.705 --> 00:01:06.676
he also cleans the house
so here's a bucket.

00:01:06.676 --> 00:01:08.386
Husbandman.

00:01:08.386 --> 00:01:10.203
- OK, does he have a secret weapon?

00:01:10.203 --> 00:01:11.808
- His secret weapon, he can--

00:01:11.808 --> 00:01:13.758
- He can balance a child while

00:01:13.758 --> 00:01:14.713
doing all the chores.

00:01:14.713 --> 00:01:15.668
- Yeah, while also doing chores.

00:01:15.668 --> 00:01:17.767
This sounds great, I love this.

00:01:22.820 --> 00:01:23.521
- Do you have an idea of what

00:01:23.521 --> 00:01:24.751
their superpower is yet?

00:01:24.751 --> 00:01:25.888
- Yes.

00:01:25.888 --> 00:01:26.599
- What is it?

00:01:26.599 --> 00:01:28.817
- All the cool ones in one guy.

00:01:28.817 --> 00:01:30.531
- I see it's looking a little familiar.

00:01:30.531 --> 00:01:31.384
- Yep.

00:01:31.384 --> 00:01:32.461
- Drawing some inspiration.

00:01:32.461 --> 00:01:33.416
- Uh huh.

00:01:33.416 --> 00:01:35.011
- Superman.

00:01:35.011 --> 00:01:36.291
Who woulda thought?

00:01:37.651 --> 00:01:39.106
Why is that the dream superhero?

00:01:39.106 --> 00:01:41.727
- Superman is the best of us in the sense

00:01:41.727 --> 00:01:43.494
that he has gone through all the trials

00:01:43.494 --> 00:01:45.201
and tribulations of slings and arrows

00:01:45.201 --> 00:01:47.101
of growth, of being hated,

00:01:47.101 --> 00:01:49.744
of not being wanted, of wanting to do

00:01:49.744 --> 00:01:51.348
everything for humanity and not being

00:01:51.348 --> 00:01:52.506
able to achieve it, being disappointed

00:01:52.506 --> 00:01:54.152
in himself and still coming back

00:01:54.152 --> 00:01:55.946
fighting every time.

00:02:00.471 --> 00:02:03.295
- It's so ugly, I don't know even...

00:02:03.295 --> 00:02:05.922
I can do better, I'm afraid to show.

00:02:05.922 --> 00:02:06.810
- [Host] Let's see it.

00:02:06.810 --> 00:02:07.440
- You sure?

00:02:07.440 --> 00:02:08.605
- Yeah, I'm sure it's great.

00:02:09.937 --> 00:02:12.022
Oh, she's adorable, yeah.

00:02:12.022 --> 00:02:13.394
- She's adorable, yeah.

00:02:13.394 --> 00:02:13.924
- What's her name?

00:02:13.924 --> 00:02:17.071
- She's kind, she's
goodhearted, she's happy,

00:02:17.071 --> 00:02:19.448
she's positive, she inspires people.

00:02:19.448 --> 00:02:20.708
- Posi Girl maybe?

00:02:20.708 --> 00:02:21.623
- Posi Girl?

00:02:21.623 --> 00:02:22.577
- Like Positive Girl?

00:02:22.577 --> 00:02:24.432
- OK, Posi Girl.

00:02:29.485 --> 00:02:33.559
- He was born in the Silicon Valley.

00:02:33.559 --> 00:02:36.546
He was meant to help us, make us better,

00:02:36.546 --> 00:02:39.553
but he's in a lot of
ways stolen our lives.

00:02:39.553 --> 00:02:40.894
- What's their personality like?

00:02:40.894 --> 00:02:42.601
- He adopts our personality.

00:02:42.601 --> 00:02:43.881
- I feel like you've
thought about this before.

00:02:43.881 --> 00:02:44.795
I'm into it.

00:02:44.795 --> 00:02:47.944
(laughs) There we go, I should have known.

00:02:47.944 --> 00:02:49.718
- iPhoneman!

00:02:54.283 --> 00:02:58.333
iPhoneman would be played by Zac Efron.

00:02:58.333 --> 00:03:00.175
(laughter)

00:03:00.175 --> 00:03:01.553
- Zac's got the legs for it.

